WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.4 · Financial Management
Restricted and unrestricted funds

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Know which money is committed to what, from the first grant or gift with conditions.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Read the conditions before you accept the money.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Give each restricted fund a code and track its balance.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Keep enough flexible money to cover core costs.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You set up your funds register, even with one or two lines.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
